From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lynxtron Authors <lynxtron@lynxjs.org>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix CEF webview registration and Windows OSR

Register the public webview alias, locate the dedicated Windows CEF
subprocess, and fix OSR surface lifetime, orientation, scaling and frames.

Upstream: https://github.com/lynx-family/lynx/pull/9189
Remove this patch once the pinned Lynx revision includes these fixes.

